{"comment_text": {"ja9:0.1": "", "ja9:0.2": "", "ja9:0.3": "", "ja9:0.4": "", "ja9:1.1": "For Maghadeva, see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn83/en/sujato'>MN 83</a> and notes there. ", "ja9:1.2": "The verse avoids speaking of “grey hair”, showing its reliance on the story. ", "ja9:1.3": "", "ja9:1.4": "", "ja9:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja9:0.1": "<article id='ja9'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja9:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja9:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja9:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja9:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja9:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja9:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja9:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja9:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja9:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja9:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja9:0.3": "Apaṇṇakavagga ", "ja9:0.4": "9. Maghadevajātaka ", "ja9:1.1": "“Uttamaṅgaruhā mayhaṁ, ", "ja9:1.2": "ime jātā vayoharā; ", "ja9:1.3": "Pātubhūtā devadūtā, ", "ja9:1.4": "pabbajjāsamayo mamā”ti. ", "ja9:2.1": "Maghadevajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja9:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 9 ", "ja9:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja9:0.3": "Sure Bet ", "ja9:0.4": "Maghadeva: a past life story ", "ja9:1.1": "Growing on top of my head, ", "ja9:1.2": "these thieves of life have sprouted. ", "ja9:1.3": "Messengers of the gods have appeared—", "ja9:1.4": "it is time for me to go forth. ", "ja9:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja9:0.1": "", "ja9:0.2": "", "ja9:0.3": "", "ja9:0.4": "", "ja9:1.1": "", "ja9:1.2": "", "ja9:1.3": "", "ja9:1.4": "", "ja9:2.1": "Maghadevajātakaṁ → makhādevajātakaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); devadūtajātakaṁ (mr) "}, "reference_text": {"ja9:0.1": "", "ja9:0.2": "", "ja9:0.3": "", "ja9:0.4": "", "ja9:1.1": "ms22J_18, msdiv9, pts-vp-pli1.138", "ja9:1.2": "", "ja9:1.3": "", "ja9:1.4": "", "ja9:2.1": "ms22J_19"}, "keys_order": ["ja9:0.1", "ja9:0.2", "ja9:0.3", "ja9:0.4", "ja9:1.1", "ja9:1.2", "ja9:1.3", "ja9:1.4", "ja9:2.1"]}